  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine flour, salt, and sugar",
    "Gradually add water and mix until a dough forms",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes until smooth",
    "Divide the dough into small balls",
    "Flatten each ball into a disk shape",
    "Heat vegetable oil in a deep frying pan to 350 degrees",
    "Fry the disks until golden brown and crispy",
    "Drain excess oil on paper towels",
    "Serve hot with a dipping sauce made from rice vinegar and chopped scallions"
